epatic hepatic ductal injuries.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="HPB2008-259141.005"/></fig><table-wrap id="tab1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Collected summary of all reported cases of extrahepatic hepatic ductal injuries from 1925 to present.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Date, Author, (Ref.) (chronological)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age (y.)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Gender</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mechanism of injury</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Nature of ductal  injury</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Treatment</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ERCP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1925, Cope [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B44">44</xref>]</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">MVC</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Confluence of R&#x02009;&#x00026;&#x02009;LHD</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cholecystostomy drains</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1929, Long [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B45">45</xref>]</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Crushed between autos</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Confluence of R&#x02009;&#x00026;&#x02009;LHD</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cholecystostomy drains</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1938, Lewis [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B27">27</xref>]</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">49</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">MV versus PED</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Confluence of R&#x02009;&#x00026;&#x02009;LHD</td><td rowspan="1" 